#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:52
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Virtual Terminal, commonly referenced and documented as man:vt[4] is the "
"system's built-in extref:{handbook}ports[virtual console].  It is installed "
"by default, provides a command-line interface, and starts automatically at "
"boot.  This chapter presents an overview and examples of key features and "
"utilities relevant to visual accessibility."
msgstr "虚拟终端通常以 man:vt[4] 的形式被引用和记录，是系统内置的 extref:{handbook}ports[虚拟控制台]。它默认安装，提供命令行界面，并在启动时自动运行。本章概述与视觉无障碍相关的主要功能和实用工具，并提供示例。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:59
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "颜色"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Virtual Terminal supports color configuration both via configuration "
"files and interactively through a dedicated utility."
msgstr "虚拟终端支持通过配置文件设置颜色，也支持使用专用工具进行交互式配置。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:64
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Loader.conf"
msgstr "Loader.conf"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Colors can be set and saved using the man:loader.conf[5] file.  To change a "
"default color, add a line in the following format: `kern.vt.color._colornum_."
"rgb=\"_colorspec_\"`, where:"
msgstr "可以使用 man:loader.conf[5] 文件设置并保存颜色。要更改默认颜色，请按以下格式添加一行：`kern.vt.color._colornum_.rgb=\"_colorspec_\"`，其中："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:71
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_colornum_` is the numeric identifier of the color to be customized (see "
"the table below)."
msgstr "`_colornum_` 是要自定义颜色的数字标识符（参见下表）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_colorspec_` is a specification of the color, either as a comma-separated "
"RGB triplet (red, green, and blue, each value from 0 to 255) or as an HTML-"
"style hexadecimal value."
msgstr "`_colorspec_` 是颜色规范，可以是以逗号分隔的 RGB 三元组（红、绿、蓝各值范围为 0 到 255），也可以是 HTML 样式的十六进制值。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:73
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Default palette: Color, color number, default color in rgb, default color in html."
msgstr "默认调色板：颜色、颜色编号、默认颜色 RGB 值、默认颜色 HTML 值。"

