#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:181
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Vidcontrol"
msgstr "Vidcontrol"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:185
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:vidcontrol[1] utility allows you to configure colors interactively.  "
"Use the `show` option to display the list of available colors:"
msgstr "man:vidcontrol[1] 工具允许你交互式配置颜色。使用 `show` 选项可显示可用颜色列表："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:189
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% vidcontrol show\n"
msgstr "% vidcontrol show\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:193
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To set the foreground color, use `vidcontrol _color_`.  For example, to set "
"the text color to green:"
msgstr "要设置前景色，请使用 `vidcontrol _color_`。例如，要将文本颜色设为绿色："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:197
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% vidcontrol green\n"
msgstr "% vidcontrol green\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:201
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To set both foreground and background colors, use `vidcontrol _foreground_ "
"_background_`.  For example, to set blue text on a green background:"
msgstr "要同时设置前景色和背景色，请使用 `vidcontrol _foreground_ _background_`。例如，要将文本设为蓝色、背景设为绿色："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:205
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% vidcontrol blue green\n"
msgstr "% vidcontrol blue green\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:210
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Configurations made with man:vidcontrol[1] are not persistent across "
"shutdown.  To make the settings permanent, add the following line to man:rc."
"conf[5]: `allscreens_flags=\"-c _foreground_ _background_\"`."
msgstr "使用 man:vidcontrol[1] 所做的配置在关机后不会保留。要永久保存这些设置，请在 man:rc.conf[5] 中添加以下行：`allscreens_flags=\"-c _foreground_ _background_\"`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:212
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Set blue foreground and green background."
msgstr "将前景色设为蓝色，背景色设为绿色。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:216
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:304
#, fuzzy
msgid "[.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#"
msgstr "[.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:220
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "allscreens_flags=\"-c blue green\"\n"
msgstr "allscreens_flags=\"-c blue green\"\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:228
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Setting allscreens_flags=\"-c _colors_\" in [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# takes "
"effect after the system boots.  To change the colors during the boot "
"process, edit [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# as crossref:virtual-"
"terminal[vt4-colors-loader,previously described]."
msgstr "在 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 中设置 `allscreens_flags=\"-c _colors_\"`，会在系统启动后生效。要在启动过程中更改颜色，请编辑 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#，如 crossref:virtual-terminal[vt4-colors-loader,前文所述]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:231
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "分辨率"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:235
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `kern.vt.fb.default_mode=\"<width>x<height>\"` option in man:loader."
"conf[5] allows you to configure the display resolution.  Technically, it "
"specifies the display mode of the Virtual Terminal, allowing you to control "
"the size of elements displayed on the screen."
msgstr "man:loader.conf[5] 中的 `kern.vt.fb.default_mode=\"<width>x<height>\"` 选项可用于配置显示分辨率。严格来说，它指定的是虚拟终端的显示模式，从而可以控制屏幕上显示元素的大小。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:237
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Sets the width to 800 and the height to 600."
msgstr "将宽度设为 800，高度设为 600。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:245
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "kern.vt.fb.default_mode=\"800x600\"\n"
msgstr "kern.vt.fb.default_mode=\"800x600\"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:250
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Font"
msgstr "字体"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:253
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Virtual Terminal allows you to configure the font in use, and the system "
"supports installing and utilizing additional fonts."
msgstr "Virtual Terminal 允许配置正在使用的字体，系统也支持安装和使用其他字体。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:255
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Select a Font"
msgstr "选择字体"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:259
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The utilities man:vidfont[1] and man:vidcontrol[1] can load a font from [."
"filename]#/usr/share/vt/fonts/#.  To list the currently available fonts:"
msgstr "man:vidfont[1] 和 man:vidcontrol[1] 实用程序可以从 [.filename]#/usr/share/vt/fonts/# 加载字体。要列出当前可用的字体："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:263
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% ls /usr/share/vt/fonts\n"
msgstr "% ls /usr/share/vt/fonts\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:266
#, fuzzy
msgid "Usually a file name has the format `<name>-<width>x<height>`, where:"
msgstr "通常，文件名格式为 `<name>-<width>x<height>`，其中："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:268
#, fuzzy
msgid "`<name>` is the font name."
msgstr "`<name>` 是字体名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:269
#, fuzzy
msgid "`<width>x<height>` is the size."
msgstr "`<width>x<height>` 是尺寸。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/virtual-terminal/_index.adoc:272
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"man:vidfont[1] provides an interactive menu in a Text User Interface to "
"select a font.  Run the following command:"
